    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="7" relname="span">An intuitive user interface is one that is easy to learn;</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="1" relname="elaboration">users can "pick it up" quickly and easily.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="7" relname="volitional-cause">A good design includes making labels conform to the terminology that the application supports.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="5" relname="joint">Ways to measure intuitiveness: # of user moves, times, and/or errors.</segment>
